  "testimonials": [
    {
      "html": "<div class=\"framer-1i06hgf\" data-framer-name=\"Container\" style=\"opacity: 1;\"><div class=\"framer-1mlu58z\" data-framer-name=\"Quote\" style=\"opacity: 1;\"><div data-framer-component-type=\"SVG\" data-framer-name=\"Quote Symbol\" class=\"framer-15g6tjo\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated; flex-shrink: 0; opacity: 1;\"><div class=\"svgContainer\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; aspect-ratio: inherit;\"><svg style=\"width:100%;height:100%;\"><use href=\"#svg10239062323\"></use></svg></div></div><div class=\"framer-10mqgxp\" data-framer-name=\"Quote\" data-framer-component-type=\"RichTextContainer\" style=\"--framer-link-text-color: rgb(0, 153, 255); --framer-link-text-decoration: underline; transform: none; opacity: 1;\"><p class=\"framer-text framer-styles-preset-4e019n\">The new UI design <strong class=\"framer-text\">cut our customer support tickets in half.</strong> It's been a game-changer for us.</p></div></div><div class=\"framer-194e1k2\" data-framer-name=\"Details / Rating\" style=\"opacity: 1;\"><div class=\"framer-191zago\" data-framer-name=\"Details\" style=\"opacity: 1;\"><div class=\"framer-1xkmb34\" data-framer-name=\"Avatar\" style=\"border-radius: 100%; opacity: 1;\"><div data-framer-background-image-wrapper=\"true\" style=\"position: absolute; border-radius: inherit; corner-shape: inherit; inset: 0px;\"><img decoding=\"auto\" width=\"76\" height=\"76\" src=\"/_assets/framerusercontent.com/images/3IIKOQ9VkCZyf0KlL2N5yBg1cQ.jpg?width=76&amp;height=76\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; border-radius: inherit; corner-shape: inherit; object-position: center center; object-fit: cover;\"></div></div><div class=\"framer-14ov9iu\" data-framer-name=\"Name &amp; Role\" style=\"opacity: 1;\"><div class=\"framer-1odysmb\" data-framer-component-type=\"RichTextContainer\" style=\"--framer-link-text-color: rgb(0, 153, 255); --framer-link-text-decoration: underline; transform: none; opacity: 1;\"><p class=\"framer-text framer-styles-preset-3j1c0u\" data-styles-preset=\"fdldKf5t1\" dir=\"auto\">Martina Martinez</p></div><div class=\"framer-jneg7s\" data-framer-component-type=\"RichTextContainer\" style=\"--extracted-r6o4lv: var(--token-994646e0-68ea-49d7-897a-104048558f6f, rgb(84, 84, 84)); --framer-link-text-color: rgb(0, 153, 255); --framer-link-text-decoration: underline; transform: none; opacity: 1;\"><p class=\"framer-text framer-styles-preset-455vy9\" data-styles-preset=\"xYEC_wF3E\" dir=\"auto\" style=\"--framer-text-color: var(--extracted-r6o4lv, var(--token-994646e0-68ea-49d7-897a-104048558f6f, rgb(84, 84, 84)));\">Customer Manager at SupportEase</p></div></div></div></div></div>",
      "text": "The new UI design cut our customer support tickets in half. It's been a game-changer for us.\n\nMartina Martinez\n\nCustomer Manager at SupportEase",
      "image": "/assets/launchfolio-051fecd67eee.jpg"
    },
    {
      "html": "<div class=\"framer-1i06hgf\" data-framer-name=\"Container\" style=\"opacity: 1;\"><div class=\"framer-1mlu58z\" data-framer-name=\"Quote\" style=\"opacity: 1;\"><div data-framer-component-type=\"SVG\" data-framer-name=\"Quote Symbol\" class=\"framer-15g6tjo\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated; flex-shrink: 0; opacity: 1;\"><div class=\"svgContainer\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; aspect-ratio: inherit;\"><svg style=\"width:100%;height:100%;\"><use href=\"#svg10239062323\"></use></svg></div></div><div class=\"framer-10mqgxp\" data-framer-name=\"Quote\" data-framer-component-type=\"RichTextContainer\" style=\"--framer-link-text-color: rgb(0, 153, 255); --framer-link-text-decoration: underline; transform: none; opacity: 1;\"><p class=\"framer-text framer-styles-preset-4e019n\">Working with Joseph felt like having a seasoned design partner <strong class=\"framer-text\">who truly understood our vision for Zazzle </strong>and brought it to life in ways we hadn't even imagined.</p></div></div><div class=\"framer-194e1k2\" data-framer-name=\"Details / Rating\" style=\"opacity: 1;\"><div class=\"framer-191zago\" data-framer-name=\"Details\" style=\"opacity: 1;\"><div class=\"framer-1xkmb34\" data-framer-name=\"Avatar\" style=\"border-radius: 100%; opacity: 1;\"><div data-framer-background-image-wrapper=\"true\" style=\"position: absolute; border-radius: inherit; corner-shape: inherit; inset: 0px;\"><img decoding=\"auto\" width=\"76\" height=\"76\" src=\"/_assets/framerusercontent.com/images/wFJgmAuVHn37SCJR5MDBtfbFdY.jpg?width=76&amp;height=76\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; border-radius: inherit; corner-shape: inherit; object-position: center center; object-fit: cover;\"></div></div><div class=\"framer-14ov9iu\" data-framer-name=\"Name &amp; Role\" style=\"opacity: 1;\"><div class=\"framer-1odysmb\" data-framer-component-type=\"RichTextContainer\" style=\"--framer-link-text-color: rgb(0, 153, 255); --framer-link-text-decoration: underline; transform: none; opacity: 1;\"><p class=\"framer-text framer-styles-preset-3j1c0u\" data-styles-preset=\"fdldKf5t1\" dir=\"auto\">Thomas Weber</p></div><div class=\"framer-jneg7s\" data-framer-component-type=\"RichTextContainer\" style=\"--extracted-r6o4lv: var(--token-994646e0-68ea-49d7-897a-104048558f6f, rgb(84, 84, 84)); --framer-link-text-color: rgb(0, 153, 255); --framer-link-text-decoration: underline; transform: none; opacity: 1;\"><p class=\"framer-text framer-styles-preset-455vy9\" data-styles-preset=\"xYEC_wF3E\" dir=\"auto\" style=\"--framer-text-color: var(--extracted-r6o4lv, var(--token-994646e0-68ea-49d7-897a-104048558f6f, rgb(84, 84, 84)));\">Co-founder of KYMA</p></div></div></div></div></div>",
      "text": "Working with Joseph felt like having a seasoned design partner who truly understood our vision for Zazzle and brought it to life in ways we hadn't even imagined.\n\nThomas Weber\n\nCo-founder of KYMA",
      "image": "/assets/launchfolio-9ae700fc8543.jpg"
    },
    {
      "html": "<div class=\"framer-1i06hgf\" data-framer-name=\"Container\" style=\"opacity: 1;\"><div class=\"framer-1mlu58z\" data-framer-name=\"Quote\" style=\"opacity: 1;\"><div data-framer-component-type=\"SVG\" data-framer-name=\"Quote Symbol\" class=\"framer-15g6tjo\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated; flex-shrink: 0; opacity: 1;\"><div class=\"svgContainer\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; aspect-ratio: inherit;\"><svg style=\"width:100%;height:100%;\"><use href=\"#svg10239062323\"></use></svg></div></div><div class=\"framer-10mqgxp\" data-framer-name=\"Quote\" data-framer-component-type=\"RichTextContainer\" style=\"--framer-link-text-color: rgb(0, 153, 255); --framer-link-text-decoration: underline; transform: none; opacity: 1;\"><p class=\"framer-text framer-styles-preset-4e019n\">Our website <strong class=\"framer-text\">conversion rate improved significantly</strong> thanks to Joseph's expertise.</p></div></div><div class=\"framer-194e1k2\" data-framer-name=\"Details / Rating\" style=\"opacity: 1;\"><div class=\"framer-191zago\" data-framer-name=\"Details\" style=\"opacity: 1;\"><div class=\"framer-1xkmb34\" data-framer-name=\"Avatar\" style=\"border-radius: 100%; opacity: 1;\"><div data-framer-background-image-wrapper=\"true\" style=\"position: absolute; border-radius: inherit; corner-shape: inherit; inset: 0px;\"><img decoding=\"auto\" width=\"76\" height=\"76\" src=\"/_assets/framerusercontent.com/images/9GxBhKhBKO9rBguUErEAr1S5msg.jpg?width=76&amp;height=76\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; border-radius: inherit; corner-shape: inherit; object-position: center center; object-fit: cover;\"></div></div><div class=\"framer-14ov9iu\" data-framer-name=\"Name &amp; Role\" style=\"opacity: 1;\"><div class=\"framer-1odysmb\" data-framer-component-type=\"RichTextContainer\" style=\"--framer-link-text-color: rgb(0, 153, 255); --framer-link-text-decoration: underline; transform: none; opacity: 1;\"><p class=\"framer-text framer-styles-preset-3j1c0u\" data-styles-preset=\"fdldKf5t1\" dir=\"auto\">Ben Harper</p></div><div class=\"framer-jneg7s\" data-framer-component-type=\"RichTextContainer\" style=\"--extracted-r6o4lv: var(--token-994646e0-68ea-49d7-897a-104048558f6f, rgb(84, 84, 84)); --framer-link-text-color: rgb(0, 153, 255); --framer-link-text-decoration: underline; transform: none; opacity: 1;\"><p class=\"framer-text framer-styles-preset-455vy9\" data-styles-preset=\"xYEC_wF3E\" dir=\"auto\" style=\"--framer-text-color: var(--extracted-r6o4lv, var(--token-994646e0-68ea-49d7-897a-104048558f6f, rgb(84, 84, 84)));\">CTO of Nexus</p></div></div></div></div></div>",
      "text": "Our website conversion rate improved significantly thanks to Joseph's expertise.\n\nBen Harper\n\nCTO of Nexus",
      "image": "/assets/launchfolio-752f243fa2f7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "html": "<div class=\"framer-1i06hgf\" data-framer-name=\"Container\" style=\"opacity: 1;\"><div class=\"framer-1mlu58z\" data-framer-name=\"Quote\" style=\"opacity: 1;\"><div data-framer-component-type=\"SVG\" data-framer-name=\"Quote Symbol\" class=\"framer-15g6tjo\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated; flex-shrink: 0; opacity: 1;\"><div class=\"svgContainer\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; aspect-ratio: inherit;\"><svg style=\"width:100%;height:100%;\"><use href=\"#svg10239062323\"></use></svg></div></div><div class=\"framer-10mqgxp\" data-framer-name=\"Quote\" data-framer-component-type=\"RichTextContainer\" style=\"--framer-link-text-color: rgb(0, 153, 255); --framer-link-text-decoration: underline; transform: none; opacity: 1;\"><p class=\"framer-text framer-styles-preset-4e019n\">Joseph's design approach brought clarity to our complex data visualizations. Our users are thrilled!</p></div></div><div class=\"framer-194e1k2\" data-framer-name=\"Details / Rating\" style=\"opacity: 1;\"><div class=\"framer-191zago\" data-framer-name=\"Details\" style=\"opacity: 1;\"><div class=\"framer-1xkmb34\" data-framer-name=\"Avatar\" style=\"border-radius: 100%; opacity: 1;\"><div data-framer-background-image-wrapper=\"true\" style=\"position: absolute; border-radius: inherit; corner-shape: inherit; inset: 0px;\"><img decoding=\"auto\" width=\"76\" height=\"76\" src=\"/_assets/framerusercontent.com/images/Ua8czSsCWvNqdtO61P3LQNscwQo.jpg?width=76&amp;height=76\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; border-radius: inherit; corner-shape: inherit; object-position: center center; object-fit: cover;\"></div></div><div class=\"framer-14ov9iu\" data-framer-name=\"Name &amp; Role\" style=\"opacity: 1;\"><div class=\"framer-1odysmb\" data-framer-component-type=\"RichTextContainer\" style=\"--framer-link-text-color: rgb(0, 153, 255); --framer-link-text-decoration: underline; transform: none; opacity: 1;\"><p class=\"framer-text framer-styles-preset-3j1c0u\" data-styles-preset=\"fdldKf5t1\" dir=\"auto\">Michael Wong</p></div><div class=\"framer-jneg7s\" data-framer-component-type=\"RichTextContainer\" style=\"--extracted-r6o4lv: var(--token-994646e0-68ea-49d7-897a-104048558f6f, rgb(84, 84, 84)); --framer-link-text-color: rgb(0, 153, 255); --framer-link-text-decoration: underline; transform: none; opacity: 1;\"><p class=\"framer-text framer-styles-preset-455vy9\" data-styles-preset=\"xYEC_wF3E\" dir=\"auto\" style=\"--framer-text-color: var(--extracted-r6o4lv, var(--token-994646e0-68ea-49d7-897a-104048558f6f, rgb(84, 84, 84)));\">Data Scientist at DataSphere</p></div></div></div></div></div>",
      "text": "Joseph's design approach brought clarity to our complex data visualizations. Our users are thrilled!\n\nMichael Wong\n\nData Scientist at DataSphere",
      "image": "/assets/launchfolio-d30cab25aa62.jpg"
